WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.594 --> 00:00:06.960
VISERYS TARGARYEN: I have only ever defended you.
DAEMON TARGARYEN: Ten years you have been king and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:11.040
yet not once have you asked me to be your hand.
VISERYS: Why would I do that? 
&nbsp;

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:17.280
DAEMON: Because I am your brother.
MATT SMITH: I play Prince Daemon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:23.200
Targaryen. He’s the sort of Prince of the realm&nbsp;
really and he’s very much an outsider. He treads&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:27.840
on the outskirts of everything and everyone
DAEMON: Much of King’s Landing is seen by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:32.880
the smallfolk as lawless and terrifying.
MATT: Daemon’s all swords and knives really.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.640
He’s also a dragonrider. He&nbsp;
has a dragon called Caraxes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:42.400
He has a great affiliation and love and admiration&nbsp;
for his brother, the King, but there’s a sort of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:46.400
deep, dark history that surrounds them. 
DAEMON: I’ve only ever spoken the truth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:50.560
and the blood of the dragon runs thick.
MATT: He’s a sort of reluctant one. I think he’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:55.200
interested in chaos, I think he survives in chaos&nbsp;
quite well. It’s not as though he wants to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:59.040
king of the land or any of that, I think he’s&nbsp;
just pretending and trying to make everyone angry.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:06.400
House of the Dragon is about war, love,&nbsp;
rebellion and deceit. In many ways it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:11.840
sort of feels at times like a big tragedy,&nbsp;
constantly waiting to sort of get worse.

